SUMMARY:Comedy at the Funk: Matty Ryan
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Comedy Fans\nModelface Comedy Club brings the best l
 ocal and touring comedians to Asheville! This week we have Chicago favorit
 e Matty Ryan in The Cultura Room!\nMatty is an NYC based (by way of Chicag
 o) stand-up/actor/writer who was a New Face at the 2019 Just for Laughs Fe
 stival in Montreal\, and taped two sets for Comedy Central’s Stand Up Fe
 aturing (2019\; 2022). His recent television credits include FOX’s Empir
 e\, Netflix’s Soundtrack\, and roles on NBC’s Chicago Fire and Chicago
  Justice. His other credits include MTV’s Acting Out\, supporting roles 
 in four indie films\, including Who Gets The Dog opposite Alicia Silversto
 ne\, as well as on-camera work with The Onion Network.\n\nAs a standup\, M
 atty has performed at New York Comedy Fest\, SXSW Comedy Fest\, San Franci
 sco Sketchfest\, High Plains Comedy Fest\, STL Flyover Fest\, and tours ac
 ross the country. Also pls tell your folks he says hi\nFeaturing Chris Hig
 gins and Sarah Love\nSeated show\, full dinner menu available\nages 18+\n\
 ndoors at 6:30pm\, show at 7pm\nTickets $18\n[https://www.eventbrite.com/.
